  "body": "Discover effortless modern living in this beautifully designed brand-new home, perfectly positioned in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nOffering 3 generous bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms (including a master ensuite), the layout has been thoughtfully designed for comfort and flexibility. Two well-proportioned bedrooms are located downstairs, sharing a stylish family bathroom, along with a single internal access garage for everyday convenience. A covered deck provides the perfect sheltered outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining year-round.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the heart of the home unfolds with a light-filled kitchen, open-plan dining and living area, guest toilet, and a private master suite. Seamless indoor–outdoor flow leads to a sunny balcony — ideal for morning coffee or evening unwinding.\r\n\r\nZoned for highly regarded schools including Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Pinehill School, this location is as impressive as the home itself. Just minutes from Albany Shopping Centre, transport links, restaurants, parks, and motorway access, everything you need is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA perfect choice for families, professionals, or investors seeking quality, convenience, and top-tier education zoning.",
